    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19162" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fūsus</span></b> , i, m.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a spindle.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 8, 48,
				74, § 194</span></i>; <i><span class="en">11, 23, 27, §
			78</span></i>; <i><span class="en">28, 2, 5,
				§ 28</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 4, 348</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tib. 2, 1,
				64</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 4, 221</span></i>; <i><span class="en">229</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">6, 22</span></i>; Prud. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφ</span>.
			10, 239; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Prov. 31, 19</span></i>.—An
			attribute of the Fates, <i><span class="en">Verg. E. 4, 46</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. H. 12,
			4</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, in mechanics, <i>a
				cross-bar</i>, <i>rundle</i> connecting two
			wheels near the circumference, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 10, 6
					<i>fin.</i></span></i></div>
